<StringTableFile xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <Name>conversations\99_custom_arena\99_custom_arena_master_script</Name>
  <Entries>
    <Entry>
      <ID>1</ID>
      <DefaultText>Another Watcher come to look into the water. Careful. It looks back, and it has a long memory.
Galawain asks one question of every living thing, and he asks it again each time you answer. Step into the ring and hear it.

Just a side note, you have [Global n_custom_arena_total_victory] wins</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>2</ID>
      <DefaultText>[Battle] Send the next one.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <ID>3</ID>
      <DefaultText>[Leave] Enough. Take me back.</DefaultText>
      <FemaleText />
    </Entry>
  </Entries>
</StringTableFile>